- Footnotes in Prospectus reconciliation (excerpt_1):
  - (a) M&A activities costs refer to acquisition-related consultants/legal advisor expenses presented in total other operating expenses.
  - (b) Restructuring cost and other: costs mainly related to efficiency projects, start-up costs for new businesses and branding/re-branding costs related to acquisitions; and specific amounts in NOK thousand extracted from financial line items total other operating expenses and payroll and related expenses relating to severance and replacement/rehiring costs. Specific amounts: for six months ended 30 Jun 2020, 2019 and full year 2019: NOK 10,561k, NOK 20,892k and NOK 48,425k presented in total other operating expenses, whereof NOK 3,245k, NOK 14,783k and NOK 39,796k relate to Restructuring costs. Additionally adjustments extracted from payroll: NOK 8,689k, NOK 14,272k and NOK 21,542k respectively.
- Audit status and currency in Prospectus:
  - The Prospectus states explicitly APMs are not audited. Currency in tables labeled “(In NOK million)” — so NOK. Publication date not included in provided excerpt header, but document context is 2020 prospectus (copyright 2020 in some pages). The Prospectus excerpts include LTM ended 30 June 2020, so likely published in 2020/2021 timeframe; exact publication date not present in excerpts.

B. Annual Report 2020 (extracted relevant text and tables verbatim from provided excerpts):
- Notes and APM section index (excerpt_0): confirms section 25 Alternate performance measures (APMs) and section 24 Events after reporting date.
- Segment reporting and numbers (excerpt_1 & excerpt_2):
