    - Adjusted EBITDA: 390,841; 307,549
    - Operating revenues: 3,539,231; 2,890,025
    - Adjusted EBITDA margin: 11.0%; 10.6%
  - Note: Slight numeric inconsistencies between different tables (e.g., Adjusted EBITDA 390,842 vs 390,841; 307,941 vs 307,549 or 307,941) — these appear to be rounding or presentation differences across tables/excerpts; the differences are small (1–392 in the context of hundreds of thousands). They should be cross-checked in the full source PDFs to reconcile units/rounding.
- Audit status and currency in Annual Report:
  - The Annual Report’s financial statements would be audited (standard for annual reports). The APMs themselves are non‑IFRS and described as alternative measures; the report does not label APM numbers as audited in the excerpts. Currency: amounts are in NOK (excerpts show large numbers consistent with NOK thousands). Publication date: 2020 annual report (title of the document) — full publication date not in excerpts but typically issued in early/mid 2021; the events after reporting date section references items in 2021.
- Subsequent events and restatements:
