C. Period-by-period matched values and reconciliation items (extracted for comparison):
- Units and clarity: Prospectus numbers were presented in NOK million and appear rounded to one decimal; Annual Report numbers appear presented in NOK (full, likely thousands). To compare, note: Annual Report Total Adjusted EBITDA 2020 = 390,841 (thousand NOK) = NOK 390.841 million, which matches the total from the segment table 390,842 (thousand) i.e., NOK 390.842 million. Prospectus mid‑year six month Adjusted EBITDA 30 Jun 2020 = NOK 182.6 million (this is six months). Annual report 2020 full-year Adjusted EBITDA = ~390.84 million.
