  - Prospectus (NOK million): Six months ended 30 June 2020: 182.6; 30 June 2019: 134.2; Year ended 31 Dec 2019: 307.5; 2018: 212.0 (or 212.4 depending on table); 2017:140.0; LTM ended 30 Jun 2020: 356.1.
