- Publication dates: Documents labeled 2020 Prospectus and Annual report 2020; exact publication dates not in excerpts. LTM values reference 30 June 2020 and subsequent events reference acquisitions closed in March 2021, indicating the Annual Report covers FY2020.
- Subsequent events: Annual Report lists acquisitions after reporting date (Tismi closed 10 March 2021, MarketingPlatform acquisition not completed as at financial statement date). No restatement disclosures are present in the provided excerpts.

F. Footnotes, explanations about differences, restatements, or pro forma adjustments:
- Prospectus footnotes (a) and (b) provide granular explanations for M&A costs and restructuring/other adjustments and specific amounts extracted from line items and payroll. These explain why certain adjustments were made and where they were extracted from in the statutory accounts.
- Annual Report notes Non-recurring items definition and content; reconciliation tables list share-based compensation in 2020 (34,711) which is included in Adjusted EBITDA adjustments (indicating 2020 had share-based comp included while prior year had none in that line). Slight numeric differences between tables (e.g., Adjusted EBITDA = 307.5 vs 307.941 vs 307.549) likely arise from rounding (millions vs thousands) or presentation differences; the full source should be checked to reconcile exact units. No explicit restatement adjustments or prior-period restatements are present in the excerpts.

G. Observations and recommended next steps for precise audit-level comparison:
